= [+ royalist_chancellor +] appointed Chancellor!

The moment has arrived—[+ royalist_chancellor +] is set to be sworn in as Chancellor today, unless it's struck down at the last minute.

In response to rumors of a Staal coup, General Halloran is sworn in unconstitutionally by President DuFour in the early hours of the morning.

- @nazi_2

@nazi_2  
title: The next [+ royalist_chancellor +] cabinet meets with the president.

Mallin arrives at Goodryke's apartment, accompanied by the leaders of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>. They are met by an agitated Goodryke, who stresses the urgency of the situation.

> *"If the new cabinet is not installed by eleven o’clock, the army will march. We’re threatened with a military dictatorship under Staal and Hammerton."*

 - Ferris Goodryke, to the leaders of the [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**CNF**</span>?], [+ year_display +]

- @nazi_3

@nazi_3  
title: Rafe Dusterel voices his objections.
on-arrival: {!
Q.hugenberg_gallax_r = 0;

if (Q.traditionalist_r < 6 && !Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r += 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r < 8 && !Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r += 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r >= 8 && !Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r -= 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r >= 10 && !Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r -= 1;

if (Q.heartland_leader != "Staal") Q.hugenberg_gallax_r -= 1;

if (Q.traditionalist_r + Q.gold_r < 8 && Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r += 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r + Q.gold_r < 10 && Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r += 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r + Q.gold_r >= 10 && Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r -= 1;
if (Q.traditionalist_r + Q.gold_r >= 12 && Q.hugenberg_gold) Q.hugenberg_gallax_r -= 1;
!}

The co-leader of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>, alongside Quillon Smitt-Harlow of the [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**CNF**</span>?], expresses serious reservations about [+ royalist_chancellor +]'s chancellorship.

Dusterel's consent is crucial for his co-leader Selden to enter the cabinet, but Dusterel, having himself been a target of <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> attacks and intimidation, remains deeply wary of a [+ royalist_chancellor +] government.

Noticing his concerns, [+ royalist_chancellor +] immediately approaches Dusterel, assuring him that the attacks were never approved by him, and with a display of sincere emotion, Dusterel relents, dropping his objections.

- @nazi_4
- @nazi_6

@nazi_4
